{
  "name": "dsh-threebody-skin",
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "description": "三体皮肤 for DeepSeek Harness：把界面换成《三体》启动片头的冷色调，片尾群山远景作为虚影叠在界面上（星空绕天极缓慢转动、四角光晕、水滴舰队），与 dsh-threebody-boot 同套件。 | Three-Body skin for DSH: the film's cold palette plus a faint closing landscape ghost with a slowly rotating starfield.",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "media",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "CHANGELOG.md"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "three-body",
    "三体",
    "suite",
    "skin",
    "theme",
    "皮肤",
    "主题",
    "外观"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "react": "^18.2.0"
  },
  "peerDependenciesMeta": {
    "react": {
      "optional": true
    }
  },
  "dsh": {
    "engines": {
      "dsh": ">=0.2.0-rc.1"
    },
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-theme",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-settings"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    },
    "suite": {
      "id": "dsh-threebody",
      "role": "skin",
      "title": "三体",
      "recommends": [
        "dsh-threebody-boot"
      ],
      "note": "与 dsh-threebody-boot 各自独立安装。同时安装时「三体」设置页由 boot 提供，本插件往里加自己的行；boot 结束片头时若检测到本皮肤，会慢慢淡成同一幅远景虚影。"
    }
  },
  "dshWorkshop": {
    "schema": "omdsh-workshop-package/v1",
    "type": "plugin",
    "integration": {
      "protocol": "harness-profile",
      "artifact": "cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "install": {
      "mode": "transactional",
      "adapter": "profile-bundle",
      "failurePolicy": "generation-rollback",
      "touchesCurrentBeforeActivation": false
    },
    "lifecycle": {
      "activation": "restart-profile",
      "dispose": "supported"
    },
    "permissions": [
      "web:index-inject",
      "web:http-route",
      "dom:overlay",
      "browser:local-storage"
    ],
    "capability": {
      "id": "skin-threebody",
      "kind": "ui",
      "invocation": "Boot the profile's Web GUI: html[data-tbskin] is set, #dsh-threebody-skin-ladder holds the --dsw-* ladder, body>.dshtbs-ghost carries the landscape ghost.",
      "expected": "The whole shell repaints in the film's cold palette with the closing landscape faintly over it; 设置 → 三体 switches it off or changes the ghost strength."
    }
  },
  "scripts": {
    "check": "node --check lib/client.js && node --check lib/index.js",
    "test": "node scripts/test-host.mjs"
  },
  "dependencies": {},
  "author": {
    "name": "chenbocheng2568-dot",
    "url": "https://github.com/chenbocheng2568-dot"
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/chenbocheng2568-dot/dsh-threebody-skin.git"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/chenbocheng2568-dot/dsh-threebody-skin/issues"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/chenbocheng2568-dot/dsh-threebody-skin#readme",
  "publishConfig": {
    "access": "public"
  }
}
